# Glossary

{% callout type="info" title="About this chapter" %}
The glossary explains the most important business and technical terms so that everyone involved speaks the same language.
{% /callout %}

| Term | Definition |
|:---|:---|
| ADR | Architecture Decision Record – a short, structured description of an architecture decision |
| Dispatch | Department that plans routes and assigns vehicles |
| Live view | Real-time view of all vehicles, routes and delivery statuses |
| Route | Planned sequence of stops for one vehicle on one day |
| Telematics | Collection and transmission of vehicle data such as position and mileage |
| VRP | Vehicle Routing Problem – the optimization problem behind route planning |
